      "created_at": "2024-06-25T12:19:20.378Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi Team</p>\n<p>We have a custom table in the quotation doctype which has severall columns which are mandatory and some which are just useful to see. I can change which columns are shown for my user but I want to set the default columns for all users. How can I set it, that it changes it for all users on the system?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/8/78e71839db3ca3fd6a9ad3f69ce24d697f93846e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/78e71839db3ca3fd6a9ad3f69ce24d697f93846e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/8/78e71839db3ca3fd6a9ad3f69ce24d697f93846e_2_690x85.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"hfypH2buEoID877KK2HFaM45cFU\" width=\"690\" height=\"85\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/8/78e71839db3ca3fd6a9ad3f69ce24d697f93846e_2_690x85.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/8/78e71839db3ca3fd6a9ad3f69ce24d697f93846e.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/8/78e71839db3ca3fd6a9ad3f69ce24d697f93846e.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F4F4\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1013×126 17.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Thanks in advance,<br>\nKevin</p>",
